  "raw_meta_yaml": "context:\n  version: \"0.3.88\"\n\npackage:\n  name: stakpak\n  version: ${{ version }}\n\nsource:\n  url: https://github.com/stakpak/agent/archive/refs/tags/v${{ version }}.tar.gz\n  sha256: 7ffae3233a6d97d4bf142392ce747a720b6c94717259ee6527deed91664eeb00\n\nbuild:\n  number: 0\n  script:\n    env:\n      AWS_LC_SYS_CMAKE_BUILDER: ${{ \"1\" if win else \"0\" }} # force CMake builder for `aws-lc-sys` native C/C++ code on Windows\n      CARGO_PROFILE_RELEASE_LTO: fat\n      CARGO_PROFILE_RELEASE_STRIP: symbols\n      # instruct `cc` crate to use clang-cl natively to compile build-time tools intended to be run on the host when cross-compiling from `win_64`\n      # (fixes compilation of `libsql-sqlite3-parser`)\n      # TODO: remove this once https://github.com/tursodatabase/libsql/pull/2256 has been merged and is used downstream\n      AR_x86_64_pc_windows_msvc: llvm-lib\n      CC_x86_64_pc_windows_msvc: clang-cl\n      CXX_x86_64_pc_windows_msvc: clang-cl\n    content:\n      - cd cli\n      - if: unix\n        then:\n          - cargo auditable install --path=. --root=\"$PREFIX\" --no-track --locked --bins --features=jemalloc\n      - if: win\n        then:\n          - cargo auditable install --path=. --root=\"%LIBRARY_PREFIX%\" --no-track --locked --bins\n      - cargo-bundle-licenses --format=yaml --output=../THIRDPARTY.yml\n\nrequirements:\n  build:\n    - ${{ stdlib('c') }}\n    - ${{ compiler('c') }}\n    - ${{ compiler('rust') }}\n    - cargo-auditable\n    - cargo-bundle-licenses\n    - cmake\n    - pkg-config\n    - if: linux\n      then: make\n    - if: win\n      then: clang\n\ntests:\n  - script:\n      - stakpak help\n      - stakpak version\n  - package_contents:\n      bin:\n        - stakpak\n      strict: true\n\nabout:\n  summary: Stakpak – Ship your code, on autopilot.\n  description: |\n    Stakpak is the open source DevOps agent that helps you with securing, deploying, and maintaining production ready infrastructure and only pings when it needs a human.\n    Generate infrastructure code, debug Kubernetes, configure CI/CD, automate deployments, without giving an LLM the keys to production.\n  license: Apache-2.0\n  license_file:\n    - LICENSE\n    - THIRDPARTY.yml\n  homepage: https://stakpak.dev\n  documentation: https://stakpak.gitbook.io\n  repository: https://github.com/stakpak/agent\n\nextra:\n  recipe-maintainers:\n    - salim-b\n",
